r:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>outDir</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컴파일 결과물 출력 디렉터리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>rootDir</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컴파일 대상 소스의 기준 디렉터리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>include</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컴파일 대상 파일 지정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>exclude</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">대상에서 제외할 파일 지정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>sourceMap</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">디버깅용 소스맵 생성</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">예시</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">json</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">{\r\n  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {\r\n    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2022&quot;,\r\n    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,\r\n    &quot;strict&quot;: true,\r\n    &quot;noEmit&quot;: true,\r\n    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true\r\n  },\r\n  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src/**/*&quot;],\r\n  &quot;exclude&quot;: [&quot;node_modules&quot;]\r\n}</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설정</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>target</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ES2022 수준의 JavaScript 문법을 기준으로 설정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>module</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ES 모듈 방식 사용</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>strict</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">엄격한 타입 검사 활성화</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>noEmit</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">컴파일 결과 JavaScript 파일을 생성하지 않음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>skipLibCheck</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">선언 파일 내부의 타입 검사 생략</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>include</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">src 하위 파일을 컴파일 대상으로 지정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>exclude</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">node_modules를 대상에서 제외</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참고</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>noEmit: true</code> — Vite · esbuild 같은 번들러가 JS 변환을 맡고, tsc 는 타입 검사만 할 때 사용 (<code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>tsc --noEmit</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>strict: true</code> 는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>strictNullChecks</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>noImplicitAny</code> 등을 한꺼번에 켠다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"